{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"尼日利亚","country_iso":"NGA","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:59:00.156077","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"NGA-HB-0006","ldc":"No","location":"卡杜纳州","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"尼日利亚卡杜纳国防大学柴光储综合能源电站","project_name_en":"Nigeria Kaduna Defense University Diesel-Solar-Storage Hybrid Power Station","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"东方国际","content":"近日，由东方国际承建的尼日利亚卡杜纳国防大学柴光储综合能源电站成功投入商运，为该大学社区的三条输电线路稳定供应绿色电力。\n该项目位于卡杜纳州尼日利亚国防大学内，包含新建一座柴光储综合能源电站、培训设施以及大学供配电网络的升级改造。2024年11月，项目已先后获得尼日利亚电力管理服务署颁发的验收证书和业主颁发的项目竣工证书。\n电站投运后，预计每年可为该大学社区供应超过700万度的清洁电力，在满足该区域低碳用能需求的同时，为大学生提供技术培训和实践机会，助力培养清洁能源领域专业人才，为当地带来显著的经济效益和社会效益。","content_sha256":"92908dc00fda07bf2050100fd3205678a629f81ae56659807b26eaf8ed773288","id":4970,"publish_date":"2025-01-21 20:32:03","title":"东方国际承建的尼日利亚卡杜纳国防大学柴光储综合能源电站投入商运","title_sha256":"817eb59dc584793c7dc84b0481c8c2ce0a48563488aa6238d51fd41ca2740f08","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/77849.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"NGA-HB-0006","capacity_details":"","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:59:00.156473","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"NGA-HB-0006-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/latest/detail/78857.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"尼日利亚国防大学","project_developer_en":"University of Defence, Nigeria","project_stage":"投入运营","project_summary":"东方国际在尼日利亚承建了卡杜纳国防大学柴光储综合能源电站项目，该项目已投入商业运营，为大学社区提供绿色电力。","publish_date":"2025-